      "a": 0,
      "t": "verbpatterns",
      "w": "<b>Insist on</b> + -ing = demand firmly that something is done. <i>Persist</i> takes <i>in</i>, <i>resist</i> takes no preposition, and <i>assist</i> takes <i>with</i> or <i>in</i>."
